       why code_only: This scope exclusion names work that was not done, and the absence
       of such changes is confirmed by inspecting the diff, so no test can demonstrate
       it.

[exclusion-02] Which model each stage calls.
    -> no-change-to-stage-model-selection  [invariant/explicit, code_only, satisfied by absence]
       The change does not alter which model each stage calls.
       why code_only: This is a scope exclusion naming work not to be done, so it is
